  "title": "What is MDASH?",
  "contentHtml": "In this episode Michael, Sarah and Mark talk with guest Taesoo Kim&nbsp;(<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" href='https://linkedin.com/in/tsgatesv'><i class=\"fa-brands fa-linkedin\"></i></a>)\n                  about the new MDASH. We have lots of news this week, too, including Certificate Services in Window now support Post-Quantum ML-DSA certificates, Microsoft moving its Q-Day up to 2029, and lot more PQ news, Mark has a YouTube channel, securing AI agents, and a lot more!\n\n                  <br><br>\n\n                  <iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://player.rss.com/azsecpodcast/3026203?theme=light\" class=\"podcast-player\" title=\"The Azure Security Podcast\" frameborder=\"0\"><a href=\"https://rss.com/podcasts/azsecpodcast/3026203/\">WhatMDASH</a></iframe>\n\n                  <h5>Links</h5>\n                  <ul>\n                     <li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" href='https://rss.com/podcasts/azsecpodcast/3026203/#transcript'>Transcript <i class=\"fa-solid fa-book\"></i></a></li>\n                     <li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/security/blog/2026/06/30/microsoft-advances-quantum-safe-security-as-the-risk-timeline-shifts/\">Accelerating the quantum-safe timeline</a></li>\n                     <li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" href=\"https://techcommunity.microsoft.com/blog/post-quantum-crypto-tech-blog/post-quantum-cryptography-and-crypto-agility/4530365\">Post-Quantum Cryptography and Crypto-Agility</a></li>\n                     <li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows-server/identity/ad-cs/post-quantum-cryptography-overview\">Post-Quantum Cryptography in AD CS overview</a></li>\n                     <li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows-server/identity/ad-cs/ml-dsa-overview\">What is ML-DSA support in AD CS?</a></li>\n                   